{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strange Jigsaws is a puzzle game where you solve strange jigsaws. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Solve around 50 or so strange jigsaws, each with their own surprising way of being solved. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Explore unusual puzzle worlds themed after jigsaws. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Enter the Jigsawverse, maybe. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a spiritual sequel to my game &quot;20 Small Mazes&quot;, but it's a little bit harder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I recommend playing the game using keyboard and mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Notes on puzzle accessibility: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> The game is color-blind friendly. There are two puzzles that use color and they both have a &quot;colorblind mode&quot; toggle on the puzzle itself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> The game has accessibility options for hard of hearing or deaf people. There are three separate track of subtitles: background music, sound effects, and voices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Some puzzles require knowledge of English. </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2702170?t=1752764273","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2702170?t=1752764273","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702170/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752764273","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702170/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752764273","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strange Jigsaws is a puzzle game where you solve strange jigsaws. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Solve around 50 or so strange jigsaws, each with their own surprising way of being solved. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Explore unusual puzzle worlds themed after jigsaws. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Enter the Jigsawverse, maybe. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a spiritual sequel to my game &quot;20 Small Mazes&quot;, but it's a little bit harder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I recommend playing the game using keyboard and mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Notes on puzzle accessibility: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> The game is color-blind friendly. There are two puzzles that use color and they both have a &quot;colorblind mode&quot; toggle on the puzzle itself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> The game has accessibility options for hard of hearing or deaf people. There are three separate track of subtitles: background music, sound effects, and voices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Some puzzles require knowledge of English. </p></li></ul>","developers":["FLEB"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702170/header.jpg?t=1752764273","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257166895,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257166895/movie480.mp4?t=1752758847","ma